, "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16051$0CFFF3A7-3AA5-4B03-A350-EA702796E0F6", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "ae1e6aff97df058242bf9b86660f85db930bbf30", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1813, "id": "Q1813"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16051$907B335F-3974-4829-9C7B-760737333A05", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "8270ccf90398318a0e98aaacfbc3d6c3daa97618", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 566, "id": "Q566"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16051$02107C8B-A02B-4768-BCF6-D2D76E311D12", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "2739a44bd669f315466f9a53db97d6a6b55112fc", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 616, "id": "Q616"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16051$E1E92B81-15B9-4B55-B5AF-6B6F67A405FD", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "8e0abffddec0903ecca01af48d389b0fbf3384ab", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1772, "id": "Q1772"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16051$DA32DC3C-8A5A-42E4-ACF7-41D4AA53CC58", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "25176b513f2f538153e5cdca588409932451f34f", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1772, "id": "Q1772"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16051$D7BC789D-A2BF-4CC9-9869-28CB98613CCA", "rank": "normal"}], "P19": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P19", "hash": "c729fd591462c72c9237d49e9f480cc8b011bd1c", "datavalue": {"value": "Yeah. Carmen was weird. That was just her nature. She was - she could be a tyrant. But the way she sang was so beautiful. Somewhere deep in that soul was I think a frightened, insecure lady. She could sure sing and play. You hear the expression, the real thing. That's what I try to live up to, the real thing, telling the truth, no matter how hard. I listened to groups that followed Lambert, Hen...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16051$979B44C1-9CA4-4243-A8AB-829AC851751E", "rank": "normal"}]}}